{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "id": "e-in-order-to",
  "lexicon": "zkv",
  "number": 181,
  "kind": "phrase",
  "headword": "in order to",
  "star": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "zh": "为了"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Jack provided some more evidence "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "in order to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " prove his point."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "杰克提供了更多证据来证明自己的观点。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "in order to 是常考词组，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：in order to do 与 so as to do 或 so that sb. can do 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：Farmers are using fires to clear the land "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "in order to/so as to plant"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " crops."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Farmers are using fires to clear the land "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "so that they can plant"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " crops."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "农民用火来清理田地以便他们能种植农作物。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Grandma opened the window "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "in order to breathe"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the fresh air."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Grandma opened the window "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "so that she could breathe"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the fresh air."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "为了呼吸新鲜的空气，奶奶打开了窗户。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Bob made up his mind to study English hard "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "in order to find"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " a good job."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Bob made up his mind to study English hard "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "so that he could find"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " a good job."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "为了能找到一份好工作，鲍勃决心努力学习英语。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
